  "html": "<p><strong>RTS平滑滤波算法</strong>（Rauch-Tung-Striebel Smoother）是一种基于卡尔曼滤波（Kalman Filter）的固定区间后处理平滑算法。</p><p>常规的卡尔曼滤波只能利用<strong>过去和现在</strong>的测量数据来推断当前状态（即实时估计）；而 RTS 平滑算法在拿到了<strong>整个时间段的所有测量数据</strong>后，通过逆序回溯，利用<strong>未来</strong>的信息来修正<strong>过去</strong>的状态估计，从而大幅消除噪声和相位滞后。</p><hr><h1>算法原理</h1><p>RTS 平滑器采用经典的 <strong>双通（Two-Pass）</strong> 结构：</p><p>1. 前向过程（正向卡尔曼滤波）</p><p>从时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k = 1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 到 <span><span data-tex=\"N\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>，正常运行标准的卡尔曼滤波。在此过程中，必须<strong>保存</strong>每一步计算出的以下变量：</p><ul><li><p><strong>状态先验估计</strong>：<span><span data-tex=\"\\hat{x}_{k\\vert{}k-1}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> （预测状态）</p></li><li><p><strong>状态后验估计</strong>：<span><span data-tex=\"\\hat{x}_{k\\vert{}k}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> （滤波状态）</p></li><li><p><strong>先验协方差矩阵</strong>：<span><span data-tex=\"P_{k\\vert{}k-1}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> （预测误差协方差）</p></li><li><p><strong>后验协方差矩阵</strong>：<span><span data-tex=\"P_{k\\vert{}k}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> （滤波误差协方差）</p></li></ul><p>2. 后向过程（RTS 逆序平滑）</p><p>从最后一个时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k = N-1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 逆序回溯到 <span><span data-tex=\"k = 1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>：</p><ul><li><p><strong>初始条件</strong>：末尾时刻的平滑估计直接等于卡尔曼滤波结果：</p><p><span data-tex=\"\\hat{x}_{N\\vert{}N}^s = \\hat{x}_{N\\vert{}N}, \\quad P_{N\\vert{}N}^s = P_{N\\vert{}N}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></p></li><li><p><strong>增益计算</strong>（RTS 平滑增益 <span><span data-tex=\"C_k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>）：</p><p><span data-tex=\"C_k = P_{k\\vert{}k} F_k^T P_{k+1\\vert{}k}^{-1}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></p><p><em>其中 </em><span><em><span data-tex=\"F_k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></em></span><em> 为系统的状态转移矩阵。</em></p></li><li><p><strong>状态平滑修正</strong>：</p><p><span data-tex=\"\\hat{x}_{k\\vert{}N}^s = \\hat{x}_{k\\vert{}k} + C_k (\\hat{x}_{k+1\\vert{}N}^s - \\hat{x}_{k+1\\vert{}k})\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></p></li><li><p><strong>协方差平滑修正</strong>：</p><p><span data-tex=\"P_{k\\vert{}N}^s = P_{k\\vert{}k} + C_k (P_{k+1\\vert{}N}^s - P_{k+1\\vert{}k}) C_k^T\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></p></li></ul><h1>状态解释</h1><p><span data-tex=\"\\hat{x}_{k\\vert{}N}^s = \\hat{x}_{k\\vert{}k} + C_k (\\hat{x}_{k+1\\vert{}N}^s - \\hat{x}_{k+1\\vert{}k})\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></p><p>这个公式是 RTS 平滑算法中<strong>状态逆序修正</strong>的核心递推公式，它的实质是：<strong>利用时刻 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"k+1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 经过平滑后的“更新估值”，结合系统的状态转移关系，来反向修正时刻 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 的估计值</strong>。</p><p>公式中各个变量的具体含义如下：</p><p><strong>1. </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"\\hat{x}_{k\\vert{}N}^s\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> —— 时刻 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 的最终 RTS 平滑状态估计值</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>含义</strong>：在<strong>融合了全过程（从第 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 到第 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"N\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 个时刻）的所有测量数据</strong>后，对时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 状态的最佳估计。</p></li><li><p><strong>角色</strong>：这是算法最终想要计算出的<strong>目标输出</strong>。</p></li></ul><p><strong>2. </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"\\hat{x}_{k\\vert{}k}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> —— 时刻 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 的正向卡尔曼滤波后验估计值</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>含义</strong>：仅利用<strong>第 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 到第 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 个时刻</strong>的数据，通过标准正向卡尔曼滤波得到的时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 状态估计值。</p></li><li><p><strong>角色</strong>：修正的<strong>基准起点</strong>（即未融合未来数据时的当前估计）。</p></li></ul><p><strong>3. </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"C_k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> —— RTS 平滑增益矩阵（Smoother Gain）</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>含义</strong>：衡量“时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k+1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的残差”对“时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的状态”有多大影响的权重系数矩阵。</p></li><li><p><strong>计算公式</strong>：<span><span data-tex=\"C_k = P_{k\\vert{}k} F_k^T P_{k+1\\vert{}k}^{-1}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span></p><ul><li><p><span><span data-tex=\"P_{k\\vert{}k}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>：时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的滤波后验协方差。</p></li><li><p><span><span data-tex=\"F_k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>：从时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 到 <span><span data-tex=\"k+1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的系统状态转移矩阵。</p></li><li><p><span><span data-tex=\"P_{k+1\\vert{}k}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>：时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k+1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的预测先验协方差。</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>角色</strong>：起到类似于标准卡尔曼滤波中“卡尔曼增益（Kalman Gain）”的作用，控制反向修正的力度和方向。</p></li></ul><p><strong>4. </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"\\hat{x}_{k+1\\vert{}N}^s\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> —— 时刻 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"k+1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 的 RTS 平滑状态估计值</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>含义</strong>：<strong>上一轮逆序递推已经计算好的</strong>、融合了全局 <span><span data-tex=\"1 \\sim N\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 所有数据后时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k+1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的平滑估计值。</p></li><li><p><strong>角色</strong>：反向传播回来的<strong>未来全局信息</strong>。</p></li></ul><p><strong>5. </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"\\hat{x}_{k+1\\vert{}k}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> —— 时刻 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"k+1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 的正向卡尔曼预测值（先验估计）</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>含义</strong>：在时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 时，仅根据当时的估计值 <span><span data-tex=\"\\hat{x}_{k\\vert{}k}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 和状态转移方程推算出的时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k+1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的状态预测值（<span><span data-tex=\"\\hat{x}_{k+1\\vert{}k} = F_k \\hat{x}_{k\\vert{}k}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>）。</p></li><li><p><strong>角色</strong>：正向预测的<strong>参考基线</strong>。</p></li></ul><p><strong>括号项 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"(\\hat{x}_{k+1\\vert{}N}^s - \\hat{x}_{k+1\\vert{}k})\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 的物理直观</strong></p><p>这一项可以理解为<strong>时刻 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"k+1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 的“平滑修正量”或“未来新发现的残差”</strong>：</p><ul><li><p>如果时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k+1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 在平滑后发现的最新估计值（<span><span data-tex=\"\\hat{x}_{k+1\\vert{}N}^s\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>），与当初在时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 预测的值（<span><span data-tex=\"\\hat{x}_{k+1\\vert{}k}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>）<strong>完全一致</strong>，则括号项为 <span><span data-tex=\"0\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>。此时 <span><span data-tex=\"\\hat{x}_{k\\vert{}N}^s = \\hat{x}_{k\\vert{}k}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>，时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的状态无需改变。</p></li><li><p>如果两者不一致，说明“未来发生的事情”证明了当初时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k+1\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的预测有偏差，于是乘以增益 <span><span data-tex=\"C_k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 后，将这个偏差<strong>反向传播</strong>给时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>，更新时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的状态估计。</p></li></ul><h1>举例</h1><p>一辆车 100 帧，第 40 帧检测框突然偏了 0.5m：</p><ul><li><p><span><strong>只有前向滤波</strong></span>：第 40 帧会被拽偏，后面几帧慢慢回来；第 40 帧看不到后面“其实没偏”的证据</p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span><strong>RTS</strong></span>：第 41–100 帧位置正常，后向一步会告诉第 40 帧“你预测的下一帧和已平滑的未来对不上”，于是把第 40 帧往回拉。速度也会被前后位移一起约束，不会某一帧突然飙一下</p></li></ul><p></p>"
}